      {
        "text": "Mud cleared from Dang Hun Mountain still holds Gruel Mud Immortal Gu power and is a needed ingredient for refining that Immortal Gu. Gu Immortals in treasure yellow heaven call Gruel Mud a one-time consumable Gu and treat the recipe as more important than the worm itself.",
